    "body": "## Problem\n\nWatcher failures are reported inconsistently, and callers cannot detect failed startup or an unexpected `inotifywait` exit.\n\n## Solution\n\nAdd an optional `on_error(err)` callback with a default logger writing to `nvim-watch.log`. Close failed handles, ignore children deleted during setup, and report unexpected `inotifywait` exits, excluding cancellation. LSP logs failures and notifies once per message, using INFO for native missing-root errors and ERROR otherwise, without interrupting registration.\n\nAI-assisted\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-09T10:39:58Z",
